{"title":"蓝桥杯练习：天干地支计算","slug":"2024-03-25-天干地支","date":"2024-03-25T01:17:25.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:56:56.057Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-03-25-天干地支.json","excerpt":null,"covers":["/images/LQ1029.png"],"content":"<h2 id=\"题目背景\"><a href=\"#题目背景\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目背景\"></a>题目背景</h2><p><img data-src=\"/images/LQ1029.png\" alt=\"题目截图\"></p>\n<p>在中国古代，时间记录采用“干支纪年法”，即通过天干和地支的组合来表示年份。天干有十个，地支有十二个，它们按固定顺序搭配，循环记录年份。本题要求根据给定的公元纪年，计算出对应的天干地支。</p>\n<h2 id=\"思路解析\"><a href=\"#思路解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"思路解析\"></a>思路解析</h2><p>解决这道题的关键在于找出公元纪年与天干地支序列之间的数学映射关系。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-数据定义\"><a href=\"#1-数据定义\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 数据定义\"></a>1. 数据定义</h3><p>首先，我们需要将天干和地支映射为列表（数组），索引从 0 开始：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>天干</strong>：甲、乙、丙、丁、戊、己、庚、辛、壬、癸。</li>\n<li><strong>地支</strong>：子、丑、寅、卯、辰、巳、午、未、申、酉、戌、亥。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-寻找基准点\"><a href=\"#2-寻找基准点\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 寻找基准点\"></a>2. 寻找基准点</h3><p>通过观察或查阅资料可知，<strong>公元 4 年</strong>恰好是“甲子年”。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>甲：天干列表索引 0</li>\n<li>子：地支列表索引 0</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此，我们可以将公元 4 年作为计算的基准点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-算法推导\"><a href=\"#3-算法推导\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 算法推导\"></a>3. 算法推导</h3><p>对于任意输入年份 <code>year</code>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>计算偏移量</strong>：<code>offset = year - 4</code>。这表示该年份距离基准年过去了多少年。</li>\n<li><strong>计算天干索引</strong>：由于天干有 10 个，循环周期为 10。<ul>\n<li>索引 = <code>offset % 10</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>计算地支索引</strong>：由于地支有 12 个，循环周期为 12。<ul>\n<li>索引 = <code>offset % 12</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>最后，根据计算出的索引在列表中取值并拼接即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\"><a href=\"#代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码实现\"></a>代码实现</h2><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 定义天干列表</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">TianGan = [<span class=\"string\">&quot;jia&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;yi&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;bing&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;ding&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;wu&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;ji&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;geng&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;xin&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;ren&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;gui&quot;</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 定义地支列表</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">DiZhi = [<span class=\"string\">&quot;zi&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;chou&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;yin&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;mao&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;chen&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;si&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;wu&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;wei&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;shen&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;you&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;xu&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;hai&quot;</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 获取用户输入的年份，并计算相对于公元4年的偏移量</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">year = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>()) - <span class=\"number\">4</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 计算天干索引 (模10)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">t = year % <span class=\"number\">10</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 计算地支索引 (模12)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">d = year % <span class=\"number\">12</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 输出组合结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(TianGan[t] + DiZhi[d])</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 复杂度分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **时间复杂度**：$O(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)$。算法仅涉及基本的算术运算和取模操作，与输入大小无关。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **空间复杂度**：$O(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)$。虽然使用了两个列表存储天干地支，但它们长度固定且很短，不随输入变化。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">---</span><br><span class=\"line\">*注：本题解基于蓝桥杯练习系统题目编写，Python 代码逻辑清晰，适合初学者理解取模运算在实际问题中的应用。*</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h2 id=\"题目背景\"><a href=\"#题目背景\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目背景\"></a>题目背景</h2><p><img src=\"/images/LQ1029.png\" alt=\"题目截图\"></p>\n<p>在中国古代，时间记录采用“干支纪年法”，即通过天干和地支的组合来表示年份。天干有十个，地支有十二个，它们按固定顺序搭配，循环记录年份。本题要求根据给定的公元纪年，计算出对应的天干地支。</p>\n<h2 id=\"思路解析\"><a href=\"#思路解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"思路解析\"></a>思路解析</h2><p>解决这道题的关键在于找出公元纪年与天干地支序列之间的数学映射关系。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-数据定义\"><a href=\"#1-数据定义\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 数据定义\"></a>1. 数据定义</h3><p>首先，我们需要将天干和地支映射为列表（数组），索引从 0 开始：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>天干</strong>：甲、乙、丙、丁、戊、己、庚、辛、壬、癸。</li>\n<li><strong>地支</strong>：子、丑、寅、卯、辰、巳、午、未、申、酉、戌、亥。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-寻找基准点\"><a href=\"#2-寻找基准点\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 寻找基准点\"></a>2. 寻找基准点</h3><p>通过观察或查阅资料可知，<strong>公元 4 年</strong>恰好是“甲子年”。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>甲：天干列表索引 0</li>\n<li>子：地支列表索引 0</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此，我们可以将公元 4 年作为计算的基准点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-算法推导\"><a href=\"#3-算法推导\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 算法推导\"></a>3. 算法推导</h3><p>对于任意输入年份 <code>year</code>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>计算偏移量</strong>：<code>offset = year - 4</code>。这表示该年份距离基准年过去了多少年。</li>\n<li><strong>计算天干索引</strong>：由于天干有 10 个，循环周期为 10。<ul>\n<li>索引 = <code>offset % 10</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>计算地支索引</strong>：由于地支有 12 个，循环周期为 12。<ul>\n<li>索引 = <code>offset % 12</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>最后，根据计算出的索引在列表中取值并拼接即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\"><a href=\"#代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码实现\"></a>代码实现</h2><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 定义天干列表</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">TianGan = [<span class=\"string\">&quot;jia&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;yi&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;bing&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;ding&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;wu&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;ji&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;geng&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;xin&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;ren&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;gui&quot;</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 定义地支列表</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">DiZhi = [<span class=\"string\">&quot;zi&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;chou&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;yin&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;mao&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;chen&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;si&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;wu&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;wei&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;shen&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;you&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;xu&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;hai&quot;</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 获取用户输入的年份，并计算相对于公元4年的偏移量</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">year = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>()) - <span class=\"number\">4</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 计算天干索引 (模10)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">t = year % <span class=\"number\">10</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 计算地支索引 (模12)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">d = year % <span class=\"number\">12</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 输出组合结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(TianGan[t] + DiZhi[d])</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 复杂度分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **时间复杂度**：$O(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)$。算法仅涉及基本的算术运算和取模操作，与输入大小无关。</span><br><span class=\"line\">*   **空间复杂度**：$O(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)$。虽然使用了两个列表存储天干地支，但它们长度固定且很短，不随输入变化。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">---</span><br><span class=\"line\">*注：本题解基于蓝桥杯练习系统题目编写，Python 代码逻辑清晰，适合初学者理解取模运算在实际问题中的应用。*</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"算法笔记","path":"api/categories/算法笔记.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"LanQiao","path":"api/tags/LanQiao.json"},{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"算法","path":"api/tags/算法.json"}]}